---
---

<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 bg-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="bg-[#F5F5F7] rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-16 border border-black/[0.05] reveal-item">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0071E3] tracking-wider uppercase mb-3">
          数据安全 · 隐私合规
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-[30px] sm:text-[40px] md:text-[48px] font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F] tracking-tight leading-[1.15] mb-5">
          连接之外，<br class="hidden sm:inline" />也在意隐私与安全。
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[16px] sm:text-[17px] text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed mb-10">
          我们重视用户的网络连接体验与基础数据安全，采用行业通用的高强度加密协议，并提醒与建议用户遵守所在地法律法规及相关服务条款。
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Feature Badges -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 text-left">
          
          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/[0.04] shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-[#0071E3] flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-1">Encrypted Connection</h3>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">高强度加密协议封装，有效防止公共 Wi-Fi 传输窃听与流量劫持。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/[0.04] shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-1">Secure Access</h3>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">骨干节点独立网关隔离，多重安全防御阻断恶意扫描与异常请求。</p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-black/[0.04] shadow-xs">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"></path>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-[#1D1D1F] mb-1">Privacy Focused</h3>
            <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6E6E73] leading-relaxed">严格践行隐私友好理念，不干涉也不分析用户正常的合法上网活动。</p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
